1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:05,913
In Lagos, an importer sends a thirty percent deposit to a supplier in Shenzhen.

2
00:00:06,313 --> 00:00:09,057
The seventy percent balance is where it goes wrong.

3
00:00:09,507 --> 00:00:13,984
Goods that never arrive: this week, a man in Bauchi was

4
00:00:13,984 --> 00:00:18,461
charged over ₦5.7 million paid for a tractor that never came.

5
00:00:18,861 --> 00:00:23,171
Over three billion dollars lost in 2025 to fake "bank

6
00:00:23,171 --> 00:00:27,480
details changed" messages. And the naira still moves in weeks.

7
00:00:27,930 --> 00:00:31,958
Arra is Latin for earnest money: the deposit that secures a deal.

8
00:00:32,358 --> 00:00:36,834
Pay the deposit, and keep the balance locked in an open contract on Celo.

9
00:00:37,284 --> 00:00:40,649
Before any order, paste the page you found them on.

10
00:00:40,649 --> 00:00:44,350
Arra's agent reads it, and searches X and Reddit for complaints.

11
00:00:47,339 --> 00:00:51,051
This example shop has two customer complaints: high risk.

12
00:00:54,201 --> 00:00:59,020
A real seller comes back green. The agent pays for this data itself:

13
00:00:59,020 --> 00:01:03,839
half a cent a lookup, over x402, through the buy marketplace on Celo.

14
00:01:04,239 --> 00:01:08,591
And suppliers can confirm their own page, so impersonators get flagged.

15
00:01:09,041 --> 00:01:13,158
Describe the order like a message, and the assistant fills in the terms.

16
00:01:17,566 --> 00:01:20,365
Vague words like "good quality" are refused, and

17
00:01:20,365 --> 00:01:23,513
the terms are fingerprinted, so they can't change later.

18
00:01:25,066 --> 00:01:28,017
Send your supplier one link. They read the terms

19
00:01:28,017 --> 00:01:31,295
in English or Chinese, and agree from their own wallet.

20
00:01:35,549 --> 00:01:37,769
You see their record and reviews, and

21
00:01:37,769 --> 00:01:40,306
a changed payout address sets off an alarm.

22
00:01:40,918 --> 00:01:44,868
Pay from the wallet you already use: MiniPay, MetaMask, Rabby,

23
00:01:44,868 --> 00:01:49,213
or any wallet on Celo. In dollars, or straight from naira.

24
00:01:49,663 --> 00:01:52,433
Lock the order. The supplier accepts, and

25
00:01:52,433 --> 00:01:55,598
the deposit reaches them instantly. The balance waits.

26
00:02:00,976 --> 00:02:05,058
Every naira payment is a Textile FX fill: one firm

27
00:02:05,058 --> 00:02:09,140
quote for exactly the dollars needed, settled in one transaction.

28
00:02:09,590 --> 00:02:13,476
That one rate matters. This October, a seven-thousand-dollar balance cost

29
00:02:13,476 --> 00:02:17,750
a quarter of a million naira more, in just twenty days.

30
00:02:18,150 --> 00:02:20,207
With Arra, it's paid for on day one.

31
00:02:20,657 --> 00:02:23,083
When they ship, the container number is checked,

32
00:02:23,083 --> 00:02:25,813
and your check period starts when the goods arrive.

33
00:02:29,542 --> 00:02:32,614
All good? Pay the balance in one tap, or in parts.

34
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:36,864
Something wrong? Report it with signed photos, and make an offer.

35
00:02:38,719 --> 00:02:41,704
Cancel before they accept. No accept, or

36
00:02:41,704 --> 00:02:45,115
no shipment, and Arra's agent refunds you automatically.

37
00:02:45,515 --> 00:02:49,547
A quiet buyer can't hold the money: ignored offers go through

38
00:02:49,547 --> 00:02:53,579
in seven days. And nobody, not even Arra, can redirect it.

39
00:02:54,029 --> 00:02:57,505
Afterwards, both sides review each other, hidden until both

40
00:02:57,505 --> 00:03:00,980
have written. Receipts and history stay with every order.

41
00:03:03,608 --> 00:03:07,128
It works for any deposit-and-balance deal: a house built

42
00:03:07,128 --> 00:03:10,648
back home, furniture made to order, a freelance project.

43
00:03:11,098 --> 00:03:15,343
Live on Celo mainnet: a friend's real order ran start to finish.

44
00:03:15,743 --> 00:03:19,285
Verified contract, a registered agent, naira filled

45
00:03:19,285 --> 00:03:23,332
through Textile, and supplier checks paid over x402.

46
00:03:24,182 --> 00:03:26,439
Arra. Trade with anyone, without the worry.
